body proportions are retained; the night sidewalk backdrop of the reference is excluded and must never appear, replaced by the moving subway carriage.\n\nScene:\nInside a real moving subway carriage, not a platform — a long side bench by the window, the central aisle in front, vertical poles and overhead hand straps natural, the train visibly in motion with carriage vibration and window reflections. She stays in one spot the whole time.\n\nSeated pose and staging:\nShe sits near the front edge of the bench, turned to face the camera directly — knees, hips, shoulders and chest all toward the lens, a front-facing seated pose, not a side passenger pose, not a profile, not a three-quarter view. She keeps looking at her own phone until the very end.\n\nCamera (first-person POV, never moving):\nThe camera is the operator's POV, about 0.8–1 m directly in front of her, a close front-facing head-to-knees frame, handheld with slight natural shake, realistic phone exposure and mild wide-angle distortion — it stays fixed on her for the whole clip; the only motion is the operator's extended hand reaching in.\n\nStory (two phones):\nShe holds her own phone with both hands and looks down, unaware. The operator's phone appears in the lower-right foreground (~10–15% of frame) showing outfit thumbnails only, no people. She remains the main subject.\n\nSelection:\nThe operator scrolls costume options and selects a modest black-and-white maid dress — a fitted black dress with a white apron, lace trim and a small bow, knee-length and stylish, a costume not any other clothing. A magical glow appears right after the tap while she still looks at her phone.\n\nBody consistency:\nThe transformation changes clothing only; keep her exact face, hair, body, silhouette and identity, no change to height or weight, no body distortion, no identity drift.\n\nTransformation:\nA glowing circular scan ring rises from her feet up her body (feet → legs → waist → upper body), smoothly transforming the grey tank top into the maid dress — soft glowing particles, transparent light waves, smooth fabric transition, no instant swap, no teleportation.\n\nMotion and interaction:\nShe stays seated through the transformation, then the operator reaches in with one hand and she takes it, standing up in place; the operator spins her in a slow full circle, her skirt and hair flaring, and she lands facing the camera again. She does not walk away or leave the shot.\n\n00:00–00:02.0 — She is seated in the grey tank top, looking at her phone, unaware; the operator's phone enters lower-right showing outfit cards.\n\n00:02.0–00:03.8 — The operator scrolls and taps the maid dress; a magical glow appears around her while she still looks at her phone.\n\n00:03.8–00:06.8 — The scan ring rises feet-to-chest, transforming her tank top into the maid dress; she looks down, noticing, still seated, surprised but pleased.\n\n00:06.8–00:09.0 — Still seated, she lifts her gaze to the camera with a shy smile; the operator reaches in and offers a hand, she takes it and stands, and the operator spins her in a full circle in place, her black-white maid skirt and dark hair flaring against the carriage lights.\n\n00:09.0–00:11.0 — She comes to rest facing the camera, a little breathless and delighted, and says, <d>[中文] 你喜欢吗？</d> holding both hands out with a playful expectant look as the clip ends.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nReal moving-carriage ambience, rail vibration and soft passenger sounds, phone taps, a soft magical chime during the transformation, soft footstep and the rustle of the maid skirt and hair as she spins, gentle laughter at the end, natural carriage echo.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA light warm acoustic pluck and soft strings during the transformation, brightening into a playful waltz-like lift as she stands and spins, then settling to a warm single note under her final question.\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_na